  "question": {
    "text": "Which statements among the following are correct?<br />\r<br />\rI. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+3</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is an oxidizing agent &amp; colourless.<br />\r<br />\rII. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> is colourless.<br />\r<br />\rIII. Actinoids exhibit a higher number of oxidation states than lanthanoid<br />\r<br />\rIV. All 3d elements give <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> with 1 M HCl",
